"ChatGPT transcription encountered Cloudflare 403 %ld times. This is usually a temporary network issue. The recording was kept; click Retry to try once more." = "ChatGPT 转写连续 %ld 次遇到 Cloudflare 403；这通常是临时网络波动。录音已保留，可点击“重试”再试一次。";
"%@ transcription failed because the private transcription endpoint returned a Cloudflare 403 challenge. This is not an expired OpenWhisper session." = "%@ 转写失败：私有转写接口返回 Cloudflare 403 challenge；这不是 OpenWhisper 会话过期。";
"%@ transcription failed: %@" = "%@ 转写失败：%@";
"Transcription prompt returned empty text." = "转写提示词返回了空文本。";
"AI Polish output looked truncated; OpenWhisper used the normalized transcript instead." = "AI 润色结果似乎被截断，OpenWhisper 已改用规范化后的转写文本。";
